{"title":"2027 AIME","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2027 MAA AIME</b> problems and solutions. The test will be administered on February 5th and 6th, 2027. The first link contains the full set of test problems. The second link contains the answer key. The rest contain each individual problem and its solution. <b>Do not create nor type in any page until date. Do not post false problems.</b>.\n</p><p><b>Notice:</b> MAA has announced that 2027 will contain only one AIME, due to cheating scandals in the 2026 season. Consequently, the <b>USA(J)MO Index</b> is no longer used to determine qualification of USA(J)MO. Additionally, those who qualify must take the AIME at a nearby Pearson Centre. You can check out the changes on the MAA website <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://maa.org/maa-invitational-competitions/\">here</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2027_AIME_Problems\" title=\"2027 AIME Problems\">2027 AIME Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2027_AIME_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2027 AIME Answer Key (page does not exist)\">2027 AIME Answer Key</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2027_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2027 AIME Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2027_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2027 AIME Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2027_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2027 AIME Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2027_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2027 AIME Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\